What the hell?

276
00:21:51,560 --> 00:21:56,760
TUANG: SENT VOICE MESSAGE

277
00:21:56,840 --> 00:21:57,840
It's Tuang.

278
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:01,720
This is Nalin.

279
00:22:06,280 --> 00:22:09,720
You wanted to see me, Tulya?

280
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:13,280
I'm at that bitch Marisa's gallery.

281
00:22:14,160 --> 00:22:15,440
So get over here now.

282
00:22:17,520 --> 00:22:19,040
So damn impatient.

283
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:24,360
Nalin, you demon!

284
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:26,920
Should we call the police?

285
00:22:29,320 --> 00:22:33,560
TUANG: SENT VIDEO

286
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:34,760
Marisa...

287
00:22:36,560 --> 00:22:37,680
Tulaya...

288
00:22:37,760 --> 00:22:39,040
Luca! No!

289
00:22:39,120 --> 00:22:40,280
And Chris...

290
00:22:43,600 --> 00:22:46,240
Chris, call the cops.

291
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:53,800
- This is 191. What's your emergency?
- Hello?

292
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:55,440
Come. Just the three of you.

293
00:22:56,120 --> 00:22:57,880
No one else. No police.

294
00:22:59,120 --> 00:23:00,560
Or Tuang...

295
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:02,440
dies!

296
00:23:06,600 --> 00:23:10,480
- Hello? What's your emergency?
- Sorry, I misdialed.

297
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:14,000
- What's your emergency?
- Nothing.

298
00:23:37,560 --> 00:23:41,440
THERE'S A DEAD BODY UNDER GOD'S HAND,
WAITING FOR HIS CONFESSION

299
00:23:57,240 --> 00:24:00,920
THERE'S A DEAD BODY UNDER GOD'S HAND,
WAITING FOR HIS CONFESSION

300
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:15,280
Shut up!

301
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,720
What's your fucking problem, huh?

302
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:34,720
The Family Closest to God's Hand...

303
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:38,440
Not anymore!

304
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:49,120
PROVINCIAL POLICE STATION

305
00:24:50,200 --> 00:24:51,120
Where are you now?

306
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:54,120
Outside the station.
Call me if anything happens.

307
00:24:54,200 --> 00:24:56,720
Wait there. Chris will call you.

308
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,600
I'll be on standby.

309
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:11,440
Gasoline.

310
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:21,720
- Tuang!
- Tuang!

311
00:25:23,600 --> 00:25:26,720
Stop this now, you bitch!
Don't touch my grandson!

312
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:32,200
What have you done to The Pornhovas?

313
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:34,360
Answer me!

314
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,600
I'm going to burn it!

315
00:25:38,320 --> 00:25:42,160
I'll burn it with God's precious grandson.

316
00:25:44,960 --> 00:25:48,360
- Don't.
- Who are you to give me orders, huh?

317
00:25:48,440 --> 00:25:49,880
Please, Nalin.

318
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:51,720
Put the knife down.

319
00:25:51,800 --> 00:25:54,560
Hello, sister-in-law.

320
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:03,160
What do you want, Nalin?

321
00:26:03,760 --> 00:26:05,360
I want you all to go to hell,

322
00:26:06,280 --> 00:26:10,080
so you'll know what my life feels like!

323
00:26:11,000 --> 00:26:13,280
Hell? Hell?

324
00:26:13,360 --> 00:26:15,000
That's where you belong.

325
00:26:15,080 --> 00:26:17,160
- Shut your damn mouth, hag!
- You shut it!

326
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:20,720
Don't hurt Luca, you vile demon!

327
00:26:20,800 --> 00:26:22,760
- Mother...
- Not you too!

328
00:26:23,960 --> 00:26:25,160
Don't!

329
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:27,680
You should do something!

330
00:26:30,520 --> 00:26:33,080
Go on. Keep fighting!

331
00:26:33,520 --> 00:26:34,880
I'm enjoying the show.

332
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:38,480
What a fucking family.

333
00:26:40,120 --> 00:26:42,560
You know what, Tulya?

334
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:46,440
My sister didn't steal your husband
to make him her bitch.

335
00:26:48,160 --> 00:26:51,160
He came to her all by himself.

336
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:56,200
Because you two fight like dogs.

337
00:26:58,040 --> 00:27:00,280
When your home turned into hell,

338
00:27:00,800 --> 00:27:01,920
Luca...

339
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:05,600
came to me.

340
00:27:06,080 --> 00:27:07,840
Such a dumb fuck.

341
00:27:08,800 --> 00:27:10,280
Wanted to play the hero

342
00:27:10,360 --> 00:27:12,280
- and find my sister's killer?
- Don't...

343
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:17,520
If you hate us that much,

344
00:27:17,600 --> 00:27:19,160
please, Nalin...

345
00:27:20,840 --> 00:27:22,920
take me instead of Tuang.

346
00:27:23,760 --> 00:27:25,960
You can do anything to me.

347
00:27:26,480 --> 00:27:29,280
Trade him for a disgraced minister like you?

348
00:27:29,920 --> 00:27:31,840
Not even worth it.

349
00:27:35,440 --> 00:27:36,960
- Please don't, Nalin.
- Hey, Nalin!

350
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:41,440
Someone caused the explosion
to kill your parents, right?

351
00:27:45,280 --> 00:27:48,120
What are you doing? I told you it wasn't me!

352
00:27:50,760 --> 00:27:54,040
If living with those scars feels like hell,

353
00:27:55,480 --> 00:27:56,960
let me help you.

354
00:27:57,840 --> 00:27:59,360
Doctors can treat them.

355
00:27:59,880 --> 00:28:01,240
It was you.

356
00:28:01,320 --> 00:28:04,240
You're the one who put me in hell!

357
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:07,400
You and Marisa.

358
00:28:09,760 --> 00:28:14,360
You unleashed a demon to hurt me,
my sister, and my mom!

359
00:28:21,120 --> 00:28:22,160
No...

360
00:28:23,640 --> 00:28:24,720
You mean Rueang?

361
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:27,960
Your father was the demon?

362
00:28:28,440 --> 00:28:29,760
Don't...

363
00:28:30,280 --> 00:28:31,600
Don't...

364
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:33,840
Every time...

365
00:28:35,280 --> 00:28:36,600
Every time he got drunk,

366
00:28:37,480 --> 00:28:39,800
he'd find a reason to hurt us.

367
00:28:40,800 --> 00:28:41,800
Every time.

368
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:48,560
I'm going to deal with you!

369
00:28:55,680 --> 00:28:56,680
Move!

370
00:28:56,880 --> 00:28:58,120
You, come here!

371
00:28:58,200 --> 00:29:01,040
You little fucker.
You don't like being a boy?

372
00:29:02,080 --> 00:29:03,560
Are you so ashamed?

373
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:06,120
Who taught you this?

374
00:29:09,520 --> 00:29:11,000
I'll beat the shame out of you!

375
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:13,440
Please, I'm begging you.

376
00:29:14,080 --> 00:29:15,960
Get out of the way!

377
00:29:16,360 --> 00:29:18,040
Come here!

378
00:29:19,480 --> 00:29:20,480
Damn kid!

379
00:29:20,880 --> 00:29:22,320
Don't hurt me!

380
00:29:26,360 --> 00:29:28,520
But the Rueang I knew was always good.

381
00:29:29,080 --> 00:29:31,000
He even asked for treats at church

382
00:29:31,080 --> 00:29:32,880
to share with you, didn't he?

383
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:35,360
He was decent when he was sober.

384
00:29:37,840 --> 00:29:40,440
When he drank, he became a demon.

385
00:29:40,840 --> 00:29:42,280
Then why did your mom let him drink?

386
00:29:42,360 --> 00:29:45,360
You were the one giving him the booze!

387
00:29:57,760 --> 00:29:59,880
You gave those bottles to him as a reward.

388
00:30:00,840 --> 00:30:02,360
But your rewards...

389
00:30:03,080 --> 00:30:05,720
were punishment for the three of us.

390
00:30:06,840 --> 00:30:08,280
What does that have to do with us?

391
00:30:09,320 --> 00:30:10,920
You could've run away.

392
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:12,040
Why didn't you, huh?

393
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:15,360
- Wait! Don't!
- Nalin, don't! Calm down!

394
00:30:15,440 --> 00:30:16,920
- Tuang...
- Calm down, Nalin.

395
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:19,040
Shut up! I won't calm shit!

396
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:23,280
You dragged us back, remember?

397
00:30:49,360 --> 00:30:50,360
Get in the car.

398
00:30:52,920 --> 00:30:54,040
Get in.

399
00:30:54,840 --> 00:30:56,880
You're married.
Why can't you talk it out?

400
00:30:57,480 --> 00:30:59,720
Why pack your bags and run away?

401
00:31:12,520 --> 00:31:15,160
Your husband keeps coming to me in tears,

402
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:19,280
begging me to find you and the kids.

403
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:29,240
I'm sorry for the trouble, Mrs. Marisa.

404
00:31:29,320 --> 00:31:31,720
Oh, it's no trouble.

405
00:31:32,960 --> 00:31:35,640
But tell me, why did you run away?

406
00:31:36,760 --> 00:31:38,160
Rueang loves you to death.

407
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:43,080
He asks me to bring treats
from church for the kids.

408
00:31:43,160 --> 00:31:45,560
He even asks me to give you my clothes.

409
00:31:48,320 --> 00:31:50,520
Go on. Tell me.

410
00:31:54,640 --> 00:31:55,760
Well...

411
00:32:08,840 --> 00:32:09,960
It's nothing.

412
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:14,960
Well, it's good you're back.

413
00:32:20,800 --> 00:32:25,240
Here. Treats from church,
and a bottle from Mr. Prateep.

414
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:32,280
Drive me this Sunday.
I've got an errand to run.

415
00:32:32,360 --> 00:32:33,440
Yes, ma'am.

416
00:32:46,080 --> 00:32:47,160
You ran away from me?

417
00:32:52,560 --> 00:32:53,720
Come here, kids!

418
00:32:56,120 --> 00:32:57,120
Let's go.

419
00:32:57,880 --> 00:32:58,880
Here.

420
00:33:09,320 --> 00:33:10,480
Please...

421
00:33:11,920 --> 00:33:14,080
You've got some nerve!

422
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:15,640
- Mom!
- Mom!

423
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:22,400
I raised you, and this is how you repay me?

424
00:33:26,240 --> 00:33:28,520
Dad! Don't hurt Mom!

425
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,320
Fine.

426
00:33:30,800 --> 00:33:31,800
Don't!

427
00:33:31,840 --> 00:33:34,840
Who taught you to interrupt? I never did!

428
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:36,480
- Dad!
- Enough!

429
00:33:36,880 --> 00:33:38,000
Please, enough…

430
00:33:38,080 --> 00:33:39,480
Please.

431
00:33:39,840 --> 00:33:41,120
Stay out of it, you little shit!

432
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:42,960
Stop... Stop it.

433
00:33:43,720 --> 00:33:45,160
Enough!

434
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:52,440
That's your dad's fault.

435
00:33:54,360 --> 00:33:55,280
What?

436
00:33:55,360 --> 00:33:58,040
You're the worst, Tulya.
Don't play innocent.

437
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:02,320
I used to believe

438
00:34:05,080 --> 00:34:06,960
that heaven could see injustice.

439
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:14,080
I was so fucking glad my dad got caught.

440
00:34:16,520 --> 00:34:17,760
Search it thoroughly.

441
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:19,560
There's nothing in there.

442
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:22,800
Lieutenant!

443
00:34:22,880 --> 00:34:25,520
I've never done drugs!
I have nothing to do with them!

444
00:34:25,600 --> 00:34:26,600
- Please!
- Get in.

445
00:34:26,680 --> 00:34:28,920
- Did you plant those drugs on me?
- Move.

446
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:30,200
Did you plant them?

447
00:34:30,280 --> 00:34:32,880
Mom, why did they arrest Dad?

448
00:34:34,440 --> 00:34:36,840
He hid drugs in the car, sweetheart.

449
00:34:40,920 --> 00:34:43,080
Will they let him go?

450
00:34:52,680 --> 00:34:53,560
Listen.

451
00:34:53,640 --> 00:34:54,520
Yes?

452
00:34:54,600 --> 00:34:55,920
We're safe now.

453
00:34:56,520 --> 00:34:59,800
Dad can't hurt us anymore.

454
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:01,080
Really?

455
00:35:01,560 --> 00:35:02,680
Yes, sweetie.

456
00:35:16,160 --> 00:35:18,960
Tickle, tickle! Take this!

457
00:35:19,040 --> 00:35:20,800
Let's get you dried off first.

458
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:24,200
But heaven is blind!

459
00:35:25,240 --> 00:35:27,280
What was the court's ruling, Mrs. Marisa?

460
00:35:28,000 --> 00:35:29,440
The case was dismissed.

461
00:35:29,520 --> 00:35:33,560
My driver, Rueang, was framed.
He knew nothing about it.

462
00:35:33,640 --> 00:35:37,240
Why don't you ask our lawyer?
She can explain it better than I can.

463
00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:39,360
What do you mean Rueang was framed?

464
00:35:39,440 --> 00:35:41,320
The police had given them prior notice,

465
00:35:41,400 --> 00:35:44,600
yet they still found those drugs in the car.

466
00:35:44,680 --> 00:35:46,560
The court's ruling is clear.

467
00:35:46,640 --> 00:35:49,360
Did your family use its influence

468
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:51,280
to distort the facts?

469
00:35:51,360 --> 00:35:53,280
- Everything was legal.
- Mom?

470
00:35:54,240 --> 00:35:55,320
Mom?

471
00:35:55,840 --> 00:35:56,960
Mom?

472
00:35:57,560 --> 00:35:58,560
Mom...

473
00:35:59,200 --> 00:36:00,320
What's wrong?

474
00:36:02,240 --> 00:36:03,480
- Mom?
- Mom?

475
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:05,240
It's okay, Mom.

476
00:36:06,040 --> 00:36:07,520
It's okay.

477
00:36:08,080 --> 00:36:09,240
I was so close.

478
00:36:09,320 --> 00:36:10,320
Mom...

479
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:13,960
I was so close to escaping that hell.

480
00:36:14,800 --> 00:36:15,800
You!

481
00:36:16,080 --> 00:36:18,080
Why did you drag me back into it?

482
00:36:19,040 --> 00:36:22,200
Why? Why?

483
00:36:22,280 --> 00:36:23,680
Why!

484
00:36:23,760 --> 00:36:28,680
You two used money and power
to turn wrong into right

485
00:36:29,520 --> 00:36:31,400
just to protect your names.

486
00:36:34,000 --> 00:36:35,400
But in return...

487
00:36:37,120 --> 00:36:40,360
it cost me my mother and my face!

488
00:36:40,440 --> 00:36:43,720
Pack your clothes. Hurry up.

489
00:36:44,600 --> 00:36:45,600
Hurry! We have to run!

490
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,440
Quickly!

491
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:51,800
Let's go.

492
00:36:52,800 --> 00:36:54,360
Ready? Come on.

493
00:36:55,400 --> 00:36:56,400
That's enough. Let's go.

494
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:57,840
Hurry! Get up!

495
00:36:58,200 --> 00:36:59,760
I said get up! Hurry!

496
00:37:00,720 --> 00:37:01,720
Come on!

497
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,760
Hurry!

498
00:37:08,080 --> 00:37:09,120
Dad!

499
00:37:11,040 --> 00:37:12,040
Bua.

500
00:37:13,360 --> 00:37:14,360
Bitch.

501
00:37:16,360 --> 00:37:17,640
You planted the drugs.

502
00:37:18,680 --> 00:37:19,800
You planted drugs on me?

503
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:21,880
No!

504
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:24,880
- You planted drugs on me?!
- I'm sorry.

505
00:37:24,960 --> 00:37:26,520
I... Please...

506
00:37:27,640 --> 00:37:28,640
Mom!

507
00:37:29,200 --> 00:37:30,640
Dad, don't hurt Mom!

508
00:37:31,080 --> 00:37:33,600
- Haven't I treated you well?
- Mom!

509
00:37:33,680 --> 00:37:35,320
- Stay out of it!
- Don't hurt the kids!

510
00:37:35,400 --> 00:37:37,040
Dad!

511
00:37:37,480 --> 00:37:38,640
Dad!

512
00:37:38,720 --> 00:37:40,040
Please...

513
00:37:40,120 --> 00:37:41,360
Want to run away?

514
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:44,360
I wasted my effort on you!

515
00:37:45,080 --> 00:37:46,200
How dare you?

516
00:37:48,200 --> 00:37:49,200
Hey! Stop it.

517
00:37:50,080 --> 00:37:51,920
Don't you dare.
That bottle's expensive!

518
00:38:01,680 --> 00:38:03,000
I told you...

519
00:38:03,080 --> 00:38:04,520
Are you fucking deaf?!

520
00:38:04,600 --> 00:38:05,840
Get off me, you shit!

521
00:38:06,560 --> 00:38:07,800
Don't!

522
00:38:08,600 --> 00:38:09,800
Dad!

523
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:12,280
Don't hurt the kids.

524
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:17,280
Don't hurt Mom!

525
00:39:04,760 --> 00:39:05,936
Where do you think you're going?

526
00:39:05,960 --> 00:39:08,400
You little hellspawn! Come here!

527
00:39:08,480 --> 00:39:10,000
- Come out!
- No!

528
00:39:10,080 --> 00:39:11,560
Come out here!

529
00:39:11,640 --> 00:39:12,720
- Don't...
- You little shit!

530
00:39:13,440 --> 00:39:15,400
Leave the kids alone!

531
00:39:17,200 --> 00:39:18,200
Get off me!

532
00:39:21,960 --> 00:39:23,480
- Come here!
- Dad, no!

533
00:39:23,560 --> 00:39:25,440
- Come here!
- Don't!

534
00:39:25,520 --> 00:39:26,640
- Come out!
- No!

535
00:39:26,720 --> 00:39:27,800
Nalin, you little shit!

536
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:32,680
Come here!

537
00:39:32,760 --> 00:39:33,760
Come out!

538
00:39:34,160 --> 00:39:35,240
I said come here!

539
00:39:37,080 --> 00:39:39,440
I'll kill you! Come out!

540
00:39:49,360 --> 00:39:51,280
- Mom!
- Mom!

541
00:39:52,320 --> 00:39:53,640
- Let go of me!
- Mom!

542
00:39:53,720 --> 00:39:54,560
Run, sweetheart!

543
00:39:54,640 --> 00:39:56,480
Let go of me! I said let go!

544
00:39:56,800 --> 00:39:57,800
Run! Hurry!

545
00:39:57,840 --> 00:40:00,400
- No! Don't do it, Mom!
- Mom!

546
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:01,680
Go!

547
00:40:01,760 --> 00:40:02,840
Let go of me...

548
00:41:13,120 --> 00:41:16,280
See? I told you I didn't do it.

549
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:18,200
It was all the Lord's will.

550
00:41:18,280 --> 00:41:21,640
Shut up, hag!
Stop hiding behind God!

551
00:41:21,720 --> 00:41:24,480
You shut up and leave Luca alone!

552
00:41:25,000 --> 00:41:26,200
How much money do you want?

553
00:41:26,600 --> 00:41:27,800
Typical of you.

554
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:32,720
Why don't you use that money
to buy your son's manhood back?

555
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:35,040
Right, sister-in-law?

556
00:41:36,040 --> 00:41:37,080
Nalin.

557
00:41:37,640 --> 00:41:39,640
Tell me what you want.

558
00:41:39,720 --> 00:41:42,120
Just don't hurt Tuang.
Please let him go.

559
00:41:42,200 --> 00:41:43,800
I'll burn him.

560
00:41:45,160 --> 00:41:47,920
I'll make you watch him die,

561
00:41:48,000 --> 00:41:51,480
just like I watched my mom die in that fire.

562
00:41:51,560 --> 00:41:52,640
Go on.

563
00:41:53,240 --> 00:41:54,360
Burn him.

564
00:41:54,840 --> 00:41:56,440
But before you do,

565
00:41:56,520 --> 00:41:58,120
tell me who killed Non.

566
00:41:58,200 --> 00:42:00,760
- Tulya! What are you doing?
- Shut up, hag!

567
00:42:04,720 --> 00:42:05,760
Chris.

568
00:42:07,120 --> 00:42:08,360
Did you kill Non?

569
00:42:11,520 --> 00:42:13,760
No. I didn't.

570
00:42:14,200 --> 00:42:15,440
Someone knocked me out.

571
00:42:16,160 --> 00:42:17,240
Non knocked you out?

572
00:42:18,920 --> 00:42:20,080
No.

573
00:42:20,600 --> 00:42:21,840
It was someone else.

574
00:42:23,560 --> 00:42:27,400
So someone else was here that night.

575
00:42:29,920 --> 00:42:33,160
And something points to you.

576
00:42:36,200 --> 00:42:39,080
Nice fantasy.
Did you win your license in a raffle?

577
00:42:39,160 --> 00:42:41,040
Answer me. Yes or no?

578
00:42:41,760 --> 00:42:43,160
No! I didn't do it!

579
00:42:43,640 --> 00:42:46,440
But you saw who killed Non.
You were here.

580
00:42:46,880 --> 00:42:47,880
I only saw Chris.

581
00:42:48,560 --> 00:42:50,880
Chris was unconscious.
So it was just you and Non.

582
00:42:51,400 --> 00:42:54,160
The evidence shows it wasn't suicide.

583
00:42:54,240 --> 00:42:55,560
That leaves only you, Nalin.

584
00:42:55,640 --> 00:42:57,360
I didn't do anything to my sister!

585
00:42:57,960 --> 00:42:59,480
Didn't do it, or didn't kill her?

586
00:43:00,840 --> 00:43:01,840
I didn't do it!

587
00:43:01,880 --> 00:43:03,080
You killed Non.

588
00:43:03,160 --> 00:43:04,280
No! I didn't do it!

589
00:43:04,360 --> 00:43:05,680
Then say you didn't kill her.

590
00:43:05,760 --> 00:43:07,680
What's so hard to say you didn't kill her?

591
00:43:07,760 --> 00:43:08,760
Say it, Nalin!

592
00:43:09,760 --> 00:43:10,760
Say it!

593
00:43:12,440 --> 00:43:14,160
She betrayed me!

594
00:43:21,040 --> 00:43:22,040
Inspector.

595
00:43:23,400 --> 00:43:26,240
She abandoned me! She didn't love me anymore!
She chose God over me!

596
00:43:27,640 --> 00:43:29,120
Nalin Sa-nguankhun.

597
00:43:29,640 --> 00:43:32,520
Do you admit to killing Non Sa-nguankhun?

598
00:43:32,960 --> 00:43:34,640
Yes. I killed my sister.

599
00:43:34,720 --> 00:43:36,160
She betrayed me!

600
00:43:44,920 --> 00:43:46,040
Don't fucking lie!

601
00:43:46,120 --> 00:43:47,640
Because you killed your sister.

602
00:43:47,960 --> 00:43:48,960
Non loved you very much.

603
00:43:49,040 --> 00:43:50,040
Put the knife down.

604
00:43:50,080 --> 00:43:51,600
You hellspawn!

605
00:43:55,240 --> 00:43:56,160
Why…

606
00:43:56,240 --> 00:43:57,800
Your family will be done for!

607
00:43:57,880 --> 00:44:00,120
You'll never even get near heaven.

608
00:44:00,200 --> 00:44:03,200
I'll take the Pornhovas down with me!

609
00:44:03,280 --> 00:44:05,840
She died right here. Look down.

610
00:44:05,920 --> 00:44:07,520
But your justice

611
00:44:07,600 --> 00:44:09,840
put the three of us through hell!
